wet sand for long takes — no stunt double.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cj"},{"id":"filmpreproduction-cl","type":"note","x":56,"y":353,"w":288,"h":194,"title":"Shortlist","body":"- **Priya S.** — best self-tape; instinctive with the guilt beat\n- **Holly R.** — strong physically; less vulnerable\n- **Erin M.** — local, knows the coast; first screen role","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cj"},{"id":"filmpreproduction-cm","type":"task","x":56,"y":563,"w":288,"h":223,"title":"Next steps","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[{"id":"filmpreproduction-in","text":"Open call posted","done":true},{"id":"filmpreproduction-io","text":"Self-tapes reviewed (38)","done":true},{"id":"filmpreproduction-ip","text":"Chemistry read with Ted shortlist","done":false},{"id":"filmpreproduction-iq","text":"Parent consent and chaperone booked","done":false}],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cj"},{"id":"filmpreproduction-cs","type":"note","x":416,"y":210,"w":288,"h":127,"title":"What we need","body":"Gruff warmth. Comic timing in the opening, stillness at the end. Water work is waist-deep at most.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cr"},{"id":"filmpreproduction-ct","type":"note","x":416,"y":353,"w":288,"h":151,"title":"Shortlist","body":"- **Malcolm D.** — theatre background, lovely stillness\n- **Bernard O.** — funny, warm; check availability in week 6","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cr"},{"id":"filmpreproduction-cv","type":"note","x":776,"y":210,"w":288,"h":107,"title":"Nothing offered yet","body":"Offers go out after the chemistry read in week 3.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"filmpreproduction-cu"}],"edges":[],"view":{"x":60,"y":50,"zoom":0.8},"updated":0}]}